
DialogID_13176=They are trusted confidants of Murong Qianqiu. It seems that Murong Qianqiu has already gone to Yanyu Villa ahead of time. We must act quickly. You should hurry to the main residence of the Yanyu Villa to inquire about the news.
DialogID_13177=The Wulin Conference has not yet begun. I suggest that you, who must be tired from your journey, find an inn to rest first.
DialogID_13178=Are you looking for the Japanese? They are cutting trees in the forest on Qifeng Mountain. It's best not to provoke them. Many people have been injured by them. It's better not to be greedy for the reward.
DialogID_13179=Please wait, young hero. To be honest, my older brother went to challenge the Japanese in order to drive them away, but he was seriously injured by them. My martial arts skills are not strong enough, so I hope that you can help the martial arts world get rid of this great threat.
DialogID_13180=Our knives are very inconvenient for cutting trees, as we lack an axe for this purpose. However, we are afraid to go to the town to get one, as it may deepen the conflict with the martial arts community in the central plains. Would you be able to lend us an axe to use?
DialogID_13181=Oh, why have you come to see me?
DialogID_13182=We have been competing with members of the martial arts community in the central plains for several days, and now our energy is not flowing smoothly. We were wondering if you could help us gather some wood.
DialogID_13183=Our leader is just ahead.
DialogID_13184=I have heard about your situation. Is there something you need from me?
DialogID_13185=What? We have never done such things. It must be a false accusation from those outsiders.
DialogID_13186=You are truly skilled, and the martial arts community in the central plains should not be underestimated. Since that is the case, I will trust you to go.
DialogID_13187=Why have you returned?
DialogID_13188=This is my token. Show it to him and he will believe you.
DialogID_13189=This is indeed the leader's token. Are you here to rescue me?
DialogID_13190=Who are you?
DialogID_13191=Our leader has finally come to rescue us.
DialogID_13192=You traitor who colludes with foreign invaders, causing harm to the martial arts community in the Central Plains, what qualifications do you have to speak in front of me?
DialogID_13193=Hmph, you little brat, don't be so arrogant. Next time, don't let me catch you.
DialogID_13194=What? You say this was done by the Shenfeng Gang? But a group of people have already gathered in the restaurant, planning to join forces and attack Qifeng Mountain to eliminate the Japanese warriors. I'm afraid it's too late now. If you don't believe me, go ask the innkeeper Maofugui if those people are still at the inn.
DialogID_13195=What did you say? They are good people? You traitor of the Central Plains martial arts. As long as they are foreigners, how could they be good people? Guards, take him down first.
DialogID_13196=You have brought shame upon yourself, my wounds are severe, and there is no going back. Take my head to see your martial arts leader, perhaps you can clear your name as a traitor.
DialogID_13197=Is there something you need, young one? This... is a head?
DialogID_13198=(Ning Ci stabbed himself with a small knife...)
DialogID_13199=These things belong to my subordinates, how did they end up with them?
DialogID_13200=Cough... a large group of people have already gone up the mountain, I'm afraid you will have to go and collect the body of that Japanese person... hahaha...
QiecuoMenu_13178=Are you Yamada Ning Ci?
QiecuoMenu_13179=Enough talk, let's fight!
QiecuoMenu_13181=Yes, please, Brother Ning.
QiecuoMenu_13186=Look!
QiecuoMenu_13187=Look!
QiecuoMenu_13188=Look!
QiecuoTitle_13178=If you want to see the leader, you must first pass my test!
QiecuoTitle_13179=Please.
QiecuoTitle_13181=Since you insist on going, then let's exchange a few moves. We will stop when one of us is hit.
QiecuoTitle_13186=Hmph, overestimating your abilities.
QiecuoTitle_13187=Hmph, overestimating your abilities.
QiecuoTitle_13188=No way!
