okmenu_13176=Okay, I'll leave now
okmenu_13177=Sure, I'll come and register later
okmenu_13178=Oh, thank you for letting me know
okmenu_13179=Okay, I'll go meet with that Japanese expert
okmenu_13180=Okay, I'll help you borrow an axe
okmenu_13181=I want to borrow a woodcutting axe
okmenu_13182=Sure, I'll help you with that favor.
okmenu_13183=Thank you for letting me know.
okmenu_13184=Have you heard the rumors about you outside? They say you harm the people, cause trouble in the martial arts world, and commit all sorts of evil deeds.
okmenu_13185=In fact, there are also such scoundrels in the Central Plains.
okmenu_13186=Hehe, Brother Ning is too kind. I will go now.
okmenu_13187=Here's the thing, your companions don't believe me.
okmenu_13188=Okay, then I'll go back.
okmenu_13189=Can you believe me now? How is it inside now?
okmenu_13190=I am Ning's friend, here to rescue you.
okmenu_13191=You should leave here quickly.
okmenu_13192=You dare to speak rudely, today I will teach you a lesson.
okmenu_13193=Hand over the sea map and I will spare your life.
okmenu_13194=This is bad, I need to go and ask.
okmenu_13195=Hmph, just with you?
okmenu_13196=I cannot do this.
okmenu_13197=Hmph, the Central Plains martial arts have made a big mistake!
okmenu_13198=Hey, why do you have to suffer like this? I will seek justice for you.
okmenu_13199=It seems that things are clear now, the Shenfeng Gang is pretending to be you.
okmenu_13200=(Oh no, I have to hurry and go up the mountain.)
story_13176_1=Recently, some Japanese warriors have arrived here. It is said that they have been causing trouble and committing many evil deeds near the Yanyu Villa. The leader of the martial arts alliance, Lin Tiannan, has issued a reward for defeating the Japanese warriors and providing information about them.
story_13176_2=These Japanese warriors are very powerful. Many well-known martial artists in the martial arts world have been defeated by them. For more details, you can ask Qian Dahe, who has the most up-to-date information.
story_13177_1=Their leader is called Yamada Ningji, with extremely high martial arts skills. He wields a strange sword, probably from the East. It is also rumored that he is the best in martial arts in Japan, and many famous people in the martial arts world have been defeated and seriously injured by him.
story_13178_1=Our purpose for coming to the Central Plains this time is simply to make friends through martial arts. However, some martial artists who were defeated by us refused to accept it and spread rumors, accusing us of doing bad things and harming the people. Our ship was confiscated by the government and we cannot return to our homeland. We can only cut down trees and build a new ship here in order to return. The lady next to me seems to have something to say to you.
story_13179_1=Our purpose for coming here was to find skilled martial artists in the Central Plains to exchange martial arts techniques. However, we were treated as outsiders and rejected by the martial arts community here. Our ship was also confiscated by the government, so we had no choice but to go to Qifeng Mountain to cut down trees and prepare to build a new ship to leave.
story_13179_2=We have never done anything wrong, this is all a deliberate plot against us. There is a gang called the Shenfeng Gang in the northwest of the forest, who once kidnapped my subordinates. I suspect they are the ones pretending to be from Japan and doing bad things. I hope you can go investigate and prove my innocence.
story_13180_1=I have a few doubts about my swordsmanship and I hope you can give me some advice.
story_13180_2=I still don't quite understand, but saving people is more important. You should go and save them first. When we have time, we can sit down and have a long talk.
