storymenu_13176_1=A bounty? Are thoseJapanese warriors in trouble?
storymenu_13176_2=Okay, thank you for letting me know.
storymenu_13177_1=They're that powerful? I have important matters to attend to, so I won't disturb you any longer. Goodbye.
storymenu_13178_1=So it is.
storymenu_13179_1=Is it true that the Japanese are causing trouble?
storymenu_13179_2=In that case, I will definitely go and clarify the situation.
storymenu_13180_1=The Central Plains swordsmanship emphasizes stability and precision. One hand looks at the sword, while both hands look at the movement.
storymenu_13180_2=Okay, I'll take my leave then. (What a martial arts enthusiast...)

